 as ever i  was hoping they'd all make it to hot  watch but that's very unlikely now as  they're all traveling off at different  angles especially when you see the third  troop  i totally missed these guys last update  up at craggy cliffs but come on how much  does this hit you in the fields i feel  like we should have some different music  now to make it cry  it became apparent they were looking at  the boats and to my surprise it wasn't  the beached vessel in the distance it's  yet another kayak the three gnomes are  now there on the shoreline putting their  teeny tiny luggage on board and on the  cliff edge those two elders continue to  watch as their comrades leave the island  does that mean these two are staying if  they're seeing them off from this angle  who knew we could care about inanimate  objects like this another bromance has  blossomed by the way this guy is a  little different from the rest he has a  book i don't know if that's important  but i feel it's worth a mention i'll  keep an eye on it for you because  honestly i have nothing better to do  with my time there is another set of  gnomes leaving the island but these guys  ain't a fan of water  gnomes at retail row decided to wait for  the bus to get out either way they are  leaving retail row just before the  halloween update hits  [Music]  so have you been keeping an eye on the  old skull villain base the grotto this  season a year or two ago this was a top  drop spot for many players but since  then it was closed and fell into  disrepair we couldn't get inside  suddenly this season something started  to happen the water levels began to fall  was this a coincidence or was something  happening here then this week it  happened again only a tiny change i mean  minuscule the muck underwater is now on  top of the water line that's literally  it just that tiny bit it does make you  think though something is definitely  happening here with halloween on the way  what is more iconic than a skull maybe  th