d  what do you think will happen is this  another bait and switch or will we  finally see inside the redacted bunker  and to confirm that this is important  when sloane and her gang got to this  crossing the cube was scheduled to go  over the road and crush it but instead  it deliberately went round that vehicle  whatever sloan is doing it's important  to the storyline so the other thing  about map changes in the last month is  that they're constantly happening thanks  to the cubes rolling around i've done my  fair share of watching and waiting and  sometimes the cubes do nothing at all  and i've wasted my time which is truly  heartbreaking but each roll brings us  closer to the end game i'm sure you've  noticed how each tumble of the cubes  creates a corruption trail right now  these are spiraling towards the center  point of the island in fact as i'm  saying this the golden cube is a matter  of hours away from its final resting  place so keep an eye on it today and  tomorrow in case you missed it over the  last two weeks the golden cube made it  to all the remaining purple cubes and  awoke them floating in the air firing  out an energy beam which somehow forces  the cube to come alive and have babies  biology isn't my strong point but that's  how babies are made if anyone asks the  thing to know is that all the purple  cubes have offspring except for one of  them the one from steamy stacks the one  we believe to be kevin the cube from  chapter one he even gives us a hint at  this by leaving kev out in the far court  of steamy stacks before rolling away  this cube doesn't act completely like  the others at one point it deliberately  finds a high spot on the island to have  a look around and stayed there for about  a day for no reason at all this cube is  unlike the others and this kevin doesn't  want to have kids it's his choice i  guess oh and a random thing happened to  me getting this shot i usually move  vehicles and builds out of the way to  make things like t